  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Ukraine and Moldova through Eurocontrol</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eurocontrol voluntary funds for Ukraine and Moldova to compensate for loss of income from aviation control services resulting from closed air space due to the Russian invation. The fund splits the funding 93.75 % to Ukraine and 6.25 % to Moldova.
The Ministry of Transport has the spending authority on this agreement.</narrative>
  </description>
